// RUN: clang-ssaf-format --type tu %S/Inputs/rt-linkage-multiple.json -o %t/rt-linkage-multiple.json
// RUN: diff %S/Inputs/rt-linkage-multiple.json %t/rt-linkage-multiple.json
// RUN: clang-ssaf-format --type tu --encoding %S/Inputs/rt-linkage-multiple.json -o %t/rt-linkage-multiple-enc.json
// RUN: diff %S/Inputs/rt-linkage-multiple.json %t/rt-linkage-multiple-enc.json

// Pins the on-disk ParameterEscape encoding against the checked-in bytes.
//
// What this pins, because the fixture is external to the code: every JSON key
// name, and the structural shape of the document -- including the
// callee-major ordering of flows_to, whose two callees interleave differently
// under any other comparison order.
//
// What it does NOT pin: any field *value*. A read/write/diff is the identity
// under any transform applied symmetrically to the writer and the reader, so
// this file is blind to which of "line" and "column" carries which field, to
// reason spellings, to the polarity of "is_candidate", to the -1 spelling of
// ThisParamIndex, and to swapping any two same-typed sibling fields. The last
// three are invisible here no matter what this fixture contains: negate the
// boolean, renumber the sentinel, or exchange two same-typed fields, and the
// file still round-trips to itself byte for byte. Measured, not assumed.
//
// Values are pinned in ParameterEscapeFormatTest, whose RoundTripsAllFields
// and RoundTripsAbsentShapes assert written bytes against literals for all 29
// scalar leaves of the format and both sides of every shape, and whose
// ReasonNamesHaveExpectedSpellings pins all 23 reason spellings. That file's
// header states the invariant and enumerates the 29 leaves by path.
//
// So: adding a field means adding a byte assertion there, not just widening
// this fixture. Key names and shape are this file's job; values are that
// file's.
// RUN: clang-ssaf-format --type tu %S/Inputs/rt-parameter-escape.json -o %t/rt-parameter-escape.json
// RUN: diff %S/Inputs/rt-parameter-escape.json %t/rt-parameter-escape.json
// RUN: clang-ssaf-format --type tu --encoding %S/Inputs/rt-parameter-escape.json -o %t/rt-parameter-escape-enc.json
// RUN: diff %S/Inputs/rt-parameter-escape.json %t/rt-parameter-escape-enc.json
